<div
	class="wp-block-gamurs-article-content">
		<p data-characters="394" data-injectable="true" data-video="true">AI is everywhere right now, from Timbaland&#8217;s generative AI music to development in the game industry. The term &#8220;AI slop&#8221; gets thrown around a lot, and players are very resistant to it, as many believe it stifles human creativity. The latest studio to comment on this is Battlefield 6 developers Dice, in an interview with the <a href="https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/c8xrkxdkkrno" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener nofollow">BBC</a>. Rebecka Coutaz of EA Dice said the following:</p>

<div
	class="has-wrapper position-sticky is-video-ad wp-block-gamurs-ad">
						</div>
    <blockquote class="wp-block-quote has-quote-icon is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow" data-current-count="104" data-injectable="false"> <p>&#8220;If we can break the magic with AI it will help us be more innovative and more creative.&#8221;</p> </blockquote>    <p data-characters="460" data-current-count="564" data-injectable="false">They were very quick to verify that <em>Battlefield 6</em> doesn’t actually use generative AI for its in-game content, even if the tech is &#8220;very seducing,&#8221; according to Rebecka. This sentiment should not come as a surprise from a massive publisher like EA, which needs to answer to shareholders and deliver massive annual releases. Even though things might change with their <a href="https://www.operationsports.com/electronic-arts-55-billion-sale-to-saudi-led-investor-consortium-is-causing-controversy/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">$55 billion buyout</a>, profits are still the top priority, and they always will be.</p><style data-injectable="false"> 	#os-app-widget { 		width: 100%; 		max-width: 56rem; 		margin: 2rem auto; 		font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif !important; 	} 	#os-app-widget * { 		box-sizing: border-box; 	} 	#os-app-widget .os-app-widget-inner { 		position: relative; 		background-color: #0f172a; 		border-radius: 1rem; 		box-shadow: 0 25px 50px -12px rgba(0,0,0,0.25); 		overflow: hidden; 		padding: 2rem; 	} 	#os-app-widget .os-app-widget-content { 		display: flex; 		flex-direction: row; 		align-items: center; 		gap: 2.5rem; 	} 	#os-app-widget .os-screenshot-wrapper { 		flex-shrink: 0; 		width: 220px; 		min-height: 450px; 	} 	#os-app-widget .os-screenshot-inner { 		position: relative; 	} 	#os-app-widget .os-screenshot { 		box-shadow: 0 25px 50px -12px rgba(0,0,0,0.25); 		transition: transform 0.3s ease; 	} 	#os-app-widget:hover .os-screenshot { 		transform: scale(1.01); 	} 	#os-app-widget .os-screenshot img { 		max-height: 450px; 		width: auto; 		